      "side": 1,
      "message": "This line seems to be causing the occasional hard GMU boot crashes on db845c. \n\nIn looking at it, I\u0027m worried that we end up aliasing the exported override_creds symbol from kernel/cred.c. I need to try to better understand the macro to make sure, but changing this to:\n   module_param_named(mnt_override_creds, ovl_override_creds_def, bool, 0644);\n\nalong with setting MODULE_PARM_DESC argument below to be for mnt_override_creds, seems to avoid the crash entirely.",
      "revId": "0ee40e0e58eb1c8a721453a1db66c5c543aa7e99",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b4c64967_2320496d",
        "filename": "fs/overlayfs/super.c",
        "patchSetId": 6
